  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THIS TECHNICAL COOPERATION PROGRAM WILL CONTRACT CONSULTING SERVICES AND PURCHASE EQUIPMENT TO SUPPORT REFORMS IN THE FOLLOWING PUBLIC ENTERPRISES: INSTITUTO DE RECURSOS HIDRAULICOS Y ELECTRICIDAD (IRHE), INSTITUTO NACIONAL DE TELECOMUNICACIONES (INTEL) AND AUTORIDAD PORTUARIA NACIONAL (APN). IT WILL ALSO INCLUDE A TECHNICAL COOPERATION FOR THE DIR. GENERAL DE ADUANAS.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
